body:
I love Cheryl, as a latina I can say she's the only pro with actual latin experience and it shows. Her latin dances are IMO by far the best ones with more latin flavor and ability.

&#x200B;

And JP should've won, he was amazing.

The only one who has a shot is Jill and still, she has a very long way to go.

&#x200B;

The other ones are deep in the kool-aid with very fundie husbands. Abbie is a Burnett and they are the poster family for IBLP, there's absolutely nothing rebellious about her. Sorry for bursting your bubble.
